	<key>
        %@%@。

        它们更适合用行内的「纯搬迁」（不留链接）：不留链接时 App Store 更新会就地写到
        外置盘上（本机实测），搬迁不会被撤销。而这里的一键迁移用的是「留链接」，
        更新有可能把链接换成真目录。

        其余 %lld 个可以正常一键迁移。
        </key>
	<dict>
		<key>NSStringLocalizedFormatKey</key>
		<string>%@%@.

These are better moved with “Move Without Link” on the row. Without a link, the App Store updates the copy on the external drive in place (confirmed locally), so the move isn’t undone. Move All leaves a link, and an update might replace that link with a real folder.

The other %#@rest@.</string>
		<key>rest</key>
		<dict>
			<key>NSStringFormatSpecTypeKey</key>
			<string>NSStringPluralRuleType</string>
			<key>NSStringFormatValueTypeKey</key>
			<string>lld</string>
			<key>one</key>
			<string>%lld app can use Move All</string>
			<key>other</key>
			<string>%lld apps can use Move All</string>
		</dict>
	</dict>
